<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-28T05:59:35.563Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:59:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab continues to launch large-scale attacks on Somali army convoys, including a deadly ambush near Baidoa and mortar shelling in Puntland that killed three civilians and wounded seven. The army reported a major battle near Buurhakaba district with dozens of its soldiers killed, while it also claimed to have killed 75 al-Shabaab fighters in the same area. Somalia denied a Turkish F‑16 airstrike on its army positions after clashes with al-Shabaab, and US forces were accused of weaponising floods that trapped women and children. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQNzM4S1gyZ0paSEFQWmpOLUd6WmZsclZsQ0hsVkNlaE02SjdueENSd2xPOFV6bWRyYmszN2ZFamtSUmh2b2hKUUlNWDB0MFJfX3RnQUFOZVFNMExBZUNWd1U5dHRZLUJkMDdhZlQzMVZldGRlczU4d0JCcHg1NktFcllXTjRDM1BZdU5qQVk2dW5LVE1pMHZ0LTAyTU1uYkhqOWNhYlVzS2I?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9lRnAyWFN6S1Q2cWx6b2pXZk1IblNMX3g0d1lpRXhqYWFPdnp4R3ctUmlnQlcyeUlJM3lldzFKVW9WdENxc21uUm9xOUg2Sy1PYV80U2VvWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPc0x4OF8wRmZ1bXpWV0ZQSnYybHJMSF81Q3NFUEVKa0piSzRJQkNGMXl3TmUxQlJZb181ZDZzRGkxVkpia3ZLd0VmQlFxeWNaZ01jYU5EbWQ3ampYeWFuSnpraVBMVzlCQ0hNaXhXSm5yc0d3M2h2NFBVSzR1Tm52dk4wdGNmbGJIVFVBM3lZZUtTdm8wVVBXcThB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQSVk5c1Q3X1BKU0h0dXZJUTNOaVpSR080QkhuOEJFbHYyeWctbTJXYVVKbHpVY0FoZFhNQ2xFRjRKeVdTNmRDbzZOWlQyRHFseGtWXzd2ZHM3amxGcjl3ZWpTYnNHTjhzOEdtYW5EVlo4TDZySkNiSGtTNGUxZzJqc1A3ZDdJY1Ztc1p3eTB3Sy03MHRPcTlhdHJLbTdWcnVaMk9pZG1SVjgyRktNa21nN0lZSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/